This fixture pins `$page.absLink()`/`$page.absLinkRef()` (issue #151): a
SIMPLE site (no `url_path_prefix`), so the composed URL is exactly
`host_url` + page path, with no prefix segment to get wrong. The
`url_path_prefix` case (prefix present exactly once) is pinned instead by
`tests/rendering/abs-link/`, which already sets one for `Asset.absLink()`
and now also exercises `$page.absLink()`.

